      EnglishDisplay: Instead of making a new attribute, and a new drawer, for a
        one-time thing, you can with this attribute, make a method that acts as a
        custom property drawer. These drawers will out of the box have support for
        undo/redo and multi-selection.
    _chineseIntroduction: "\u4F7F\u7528 CustomValueDrawer \u7279\u6027\uFF0C\u4EE3\u66FF\u58F0\u660E\u4E00\u4E2A
